Package: dynhr
Title: DSGE Modelling Toolkit (Parsing, Solving, Estimating, Diagnosing)
Version: 0.9.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chris", "Ball", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "chrispball1@gmail.com"))
Description: Parses Dynare .mod files, solves the resulting models by
    first-order perturbation, runs Bayesian estimation (random-walk
    Metropolis-Hastings, sequential Monte Carlo, NUTS), and reports a
    battery of identification, convergence, fit, and narrative
    diagnostics. A self-contained R alternative to Dynare for medium
    scale DSGE models, with a parity test suite against Dynare and
    Dynare.jl.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/Ball-Christopher/dynhr
BugReports: https://github.com/Ball-Christopher/dynhr/issues
